    "name": "managing-cloud-identity-with-okta",
    "description": "Implement Okta as a centralized cloud identity provider: configure SSO with AWS, Azure, and GCP, deploy phishing-resistant MFA with Okta FastPass, automate user provisioning/deprovisioning, and enforce adaptive access policies on device posture and risk signals. Use when standing up Okta SSO, rolling out FastPass MFA, automating identity lifecycle, or building risk-based conditional access for cloud environments.",
